msgstr "[Trascrizione (ENG)](https://wiki.tomasino.org/writing/Solarpunk-Prompts---The-Epidemiologists)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/seeds/the-expedition/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Expedition"
msgstr "La Spedizione"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/seeds/the-expedition/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> A group of doctors and engineers from a Global South country are sent on a mission in the North, helping the specialists there live in the world after The Great Internet Collapse, where the AIs will no longer make suggestions and the Clouds can’t calculate the load bearing strength of a pillar.\n"
msgstr "> Una squadra di dottori e ingegneri dal Sud Globale (come ad esempio Cuba durante il COVID-19) in una missione nel Nord Globale, volta ad aiutare gli specialisti del paese nel fronteggiare il Grande Collasso dell’Internet. Le IA non forniscono più suggerimenti e i cloud non riescono a calcolare con precisione la portata di muri e colonne.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/seeds/the-expedition/index.en.md
msgid "[Solarpunk Prompts Podcast Episode](https://podcast.tomasino.org/@SolarpunkPrompts/episodes/the-expedition)"
msgstr "[Episodi Solarpunk Prompts Podcast](https://podcast.tomasino.org/@SolarpunkPrompts/episodes/the-expedition)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/seeds/the-expedition/index.en.md
msgid "[Transcript](https://wiki.tomasino.org/writing/Solarpunk-Prompts---The-Expedition)"
msgstr "[Trascrizione (ENG)](https://wiki.tomasino.org/writing/Solarpunk-Prompts---The-Expedition)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/seeds/the-experts/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Experts"
msgstr "Gli Esperti"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/seeds/the-experts/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> There is a community of very specialized experts. Only a handful exist in the whole world. They are normally hermits, focused on maintaining long-forgotten infrastructure. But their community exists across the internet. They consider themselves a family, even if each of them speaks a different language, and comes from a different culture. And once a blue moon they can even physically visit each other.\n"
msgstr "> Una comunità virtuale di esperti molto specializzati, pochi dei quali interagiscono con il mondo reale. Eremiti, conservazionisti, manutentori di infrastrutture dimenticate da lungo tempo, si considerano una famiglia nonostante parlino lingue molto diverse e provengano da culture altrettanto distanti. Raramente riescono a riunirsi fisicamente.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/seeds/the-experts/index.en.md
msgid "[Solarpunk Prompts Podcast Episode](https://podcast.tomasino.org/@SolarpunkPrompts/episodes/the-experts)"
msgstr "[Episodio Solarpunk Prompts Podcast](https://podcast.tomasino.org/@SolarpunkPrompts/episodes/the-experts)"

